00:32:34.410 --> 00:32:36.620
So I can do it for less time.

00:32:36.620 --> 00:32:39.290
Let's change this 30 to 15.

00:32:39.290 --> 00:32:41.840
And let's let that percolate.

00:32:47.820 --> 00:32:51.750
What it's going to do is
basically hammer on the service

00:32:51.750 --> 00:32:53.880
I just deployed.

00:32:53.880 --> 00:32:55.780
And it's going to
