00:34:08.040 --> 00:34:10.770
And the key idea here
that I want to point out

00:34:10.770 --> 00:34:14.639
is that if you send
a lot of traffic,

00:34:14.639 --> 00:34:18.360
Cloud Run is just going
to automatically expand

00:34:18.360 --> 00:34:23.100
