providing in order to enable

00:34:23.100 --> 00:34:24.600
you to keep up with the demand.

00:34:24.600 --> 00:34:28.650
So it will grow and it will
shrink based on the traffic.

00:34:28.650 --> 00:34:31.500
And this goes back to
